      "content": "wait i actually do have some mild kidney issues, my doctor said my creatinine is a bit high but nothing serious. so do you think i should just cut the dose in half like maybe 400mg? i really dont want to go back to the doctor if i dont have to, it's such a hassle and seems like a lot for just leg cramps. is 400mg safe enough that i wont get sick?",
